 "playtime_forever": 38, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 38, "last_played": 1691435145, "avatar": "5e3a68b1f39c1eac172d882b2ed83948d98763b7"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the most ass games ive ever played. Darryl recommended this ♥♥♥♥ and its ass", "timestamp_created": 1691435423, "timestamp_updated": 1691435423, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.446154177188873291", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143603363", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993961640", "personaname": "rootbox", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993961640/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4178, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1968, "last_played": 1737761921, "avatar": "2be56ac851c8ef31300eaf9898d702cf6feea0fd"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's like a drug.. you'll need around 2 hours after the last round to reconnect to RL.", "timestamp_created": 1691430942, "timestamp_updated": 1691430942, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143596761", "author": {"steamid": "76561198015074622", "personaname": "Solemn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/guitarzombee93/", "num_games_owned": 567, "num_reviews": 314, "playtime_forever": 266, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 72, "last_played": 1748583154, "avatar": "43a1783de3604f698f23ea624a459b697ff54d0b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Frenetic fun to be had here! Plenty of guns to keep you running the gauntlet again and again. Also seems like they have plenty of content in store for the future. I would like to see more permanent Crab upgrades. Yes, you defeat Bosses, get keys, permanently unlock weapons, but I want to see things like starting armor, small beginning damage buffs (3%/6%/9%), customized beginning loadouts (maybe with the option to select a starting element with 0% chance to find new elements, only upgrade to the current), the ability to cancel your slide with another tap of the shift key, or whatever you bind it to.\n\nEither way, I have no problem recommending this to anyone who enjoys movement based shooters/rougelikes/platforming. It's the best of multiple worlds and I'm confident it will continue to grow into something even more so. Join the rave!", "timestamp_created": 1691423854, "timestamp_updated": 1691423854, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}]}